%% System L9: kurikulum consult hop (eng / ops)
%% Hermes kasir_consult → Nest double-gate → Studio RAG notebook → WA copy
%% Cite: hlm from chunk "-- N of M --". Optional metrics: KASIR_CONSULT_INJECT_METRICS.
flowchart LR
  O[Owner: tanya / konsultasi / pendamping] --> H[Hermes SOUL]
  H --> T[kasir_consult tool]
  T -->|KASIR_CONSULT=0| Off[Copy: belum aktif]
  T -->|KASIR_CONSULT=1| HTTP[POST /internal/kasir-consult<br/>X-Kasir-Consult-Key + phone?]
  HTTP --> N[Nest middleware]
  N -->|flag off / bad key| Off2[off / 401]
  N -->|ok| Rag[consultFromNotebook]
  Rag --> Emb[embed query]
  Emb --> Match[match_studio_chunks<br/>notebook kurikulum]
  Match -->|hits| Syn[LLM synthesize ≤800<br/>+ cite hlm bila ada]
  Match -->|0 hits| Miss[Miss copy — no free LLM]
  Syn --> WA[Jawaban WA]
  Miss --> WA

  Inj{KASIR_CONSULT_INJECT_METRICS=1<br/>+ phone?}
  Rag -.-> Inj
  Inj -->|yes| Snap[today-report snapshot<br/>BLOK_KASIR label tools]
  Snap -.->|synthesize only| Syn
  Inj -->|no| Syn

  DB[(Ledger stok/omzet)] -.->|FORBIDDEN into retrieve| Rag
